      "cooked": "<p>\n\n\nLocal Diaspora is&nbsp;only event that doesn't scale at all with number of players/boards. Whether 1 player or 4 players, the text as is affects only 1 land on the island.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Is that a typo/mistake? Or if not, I'm curious why this one event is different?</p>",
